==English==
{{wikipedia|dab=television set}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[television]] [[set]]}}

# {{context|dated|before 1960}} A [[television]]; an [[electronic]] [[device]] that [[receive]]s television [[signal]]s, and [[display]]s the resulting [[image]]s on a [[screen]].

